  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 404.08 Official Warning. Pursuant to RSA 316-A:3, XIII the board shall issue a non-public official warning in the form of a letter of concern to a licensee if it determines through investigation that the licensee has engaged in a violation of Ch 406.\n\nSource. #8739, eff 10-11-06, EXPIRED: 10-11-14\n\nNew. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17\n\nNew. #12431, eff 12-8-17; renumbered by #13327 (formerly Ch 403.08) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ch 400)",
